#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/avr-stub.rst:15
msgid "avr-stub"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/avr-stub.rst:17
msgid ""
"avr-stub is a source level debugger based on GDB stub mechanism. It works "
"with ATmega328 and Arduino Mega microcontrollers without an external "
"programmer. The official reference can be found `here  <https://github.com/"
"jdolinay/avr_debug/?utm_source=platformio&utm_medium=docs>`__."
msgstr ""

