msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/avr-stub_extra.rst:19
msgid ""
"In a nutshell, avr-stub is a piece of software (stub) that is added to your "
"application and communicates with PlatformIO when a debug session is "
"running. It requires several additional configuration steps in order to use "
"it as a debug tool. To use avr-stub, the following settings in :ref:"
"`projectconf`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/avr-stub_extra.rst:37
msgid ""
"Where the value in :ref:`projectconf_debug_port` is a serial port connected "
"to your board and ``jdolinay/avr-debugger`` is a special library that "
"implements the GDB stub."
msgstr ""

